  </item>
  <item>
    <title>004. 面对催婚最重要的事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a8aa9dd74435e4a31127a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a8aa9dd74435e4a31127a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Feb 2025 13:31:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsdiJp85hytB1VXHam4dfwDIDkvS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>春节过后，是否有人对你说「该找对象了」、「年纪不小了」？面对父母的殷切期望，你是否也感到焦虑和困扰？</span></p><span></span><p><span>刀刀和田田就是这样两位与催婚「相爱相杀」多年的资深人士 - 田田在 28 岁就找到了自己的答案，而刀刀则用了 35 年才想明白；一个是「老催婚户」，一个是「新晋解脱者」。在今天的节目里，她们将分享十年磨合的心路历程，带你一起探索如何在催婚洪流中保持内心的平静，找到最适合自己的生活方式。</span><br><span></span><br><span>【时间轴】</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a></span></strong><span> 每逢佳节倍催婚，这样的日子已持续了十几年</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a></span></strong><span> 从近期重大娱乐新闻说开去</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a></span></strong><span> 警惕伪装成爱的叙事陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a></span></strong><span> 刀刀的转折点时刻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a></span></strong><span> 田田在“模糊模拟婚姻日常生活”中做饭时的顿悟</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a></span></strong><span> 但人还是要恋爱的，寻找自我和答案的一种身体力行</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a></span></strong><span> 归纳父母磨合十年规划的三大阶段</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a></span></strong><span> 信任储备期的会议桌牌小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a></span></strong><span> 轻沟通，微分享，更轻松</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1584">26:24</a></span></strong><span> 以死相逼的父母，极端底牌模式</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a></span></strong><span> 有点悲伤和残酷的上帝视角转变，是人生必经一课</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a></span></strong><span> 共识重塑期，可能妈妈“进步”得会快点儿</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1872">31:12</a></span></strong><span> 答案不在别处，自己成为自己的确定性</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bruno Mars - Count On Me</span></p><span></span><p><span>Alphaville - Forever Young</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期封面】</span></p><span></span><p><span>父母背影，田田拍摄</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>刀刀&amp;田田</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66f236a09d0d9274cd5b4014/ls91mkxyhWwOZ4AO-9PRNeUCkQIA.m4a" length="33031224" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYfizBcPrL4WJiV-N2JCIImNk8f.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>003. 你为什么总是这么累？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678d13479420ede9d12e0878</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678d13479420ede9d12e0878</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 15:08:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgBnL0n1rxP_gJzLTHKDVzJIdzqv.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>生活中的疲惫就像一只看不见的大象，总是默默跟随着我们。从深夜加班到清晨通勤，从密集会议到无休止的邮件，现代人似乎总在与疲劳打交道。但在这个永不停歇的城市里，要如何找到属于自己的休息节奏？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在今天的节目里，刀刀和田田将分享她们对抗疲劳的心得，带你发现不一样的休息方式，找回属于自己的生活节奏。两个都经历过高强度工作的普通人，在摸爬滚打中找到了各自的「续命秘籍」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>📝 探索疲劳的真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 从倒在办公室地板上说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a> 工作压力下的情绪负载</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 像后台运行的大脑消耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> 被愧疚感占据的情绪空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 疲惫是身体的温柔提醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">13:47</a> 清理大脑的运行内存</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕵️ 不同的视角看待这些压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="991">16:31</a> 运用圆球思维看待压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 寻找身体关节的放松方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a> 主动放松替代刷手机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 用烹饪视频缓解焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔍 科学缓解之道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 探索肠道菌群与疲劳关联</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1752">29:12</a> 拥抱阳光与维生素D</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a> 将健康融入生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2242">37:22</a> 坚持每周两次运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2399">39:59</a> 十分钟泡沫轴舒适之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>周华健 - Far Far Away</span></p><span></span><p><span>TopHouse - The Mountain Song</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期封面】</span></p><span></span><p><span>布里斯班海滩，刀刀拍摄</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>刀刀&amp;田田</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66f236a09d0d9274cd5b4014/ljFJF4o31F9DRel-DlX_H8WLxSDk.m4a" length="41509454" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FizAVA7VRj-aak8kORBa-_t1FaXZ.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>日本特辑①：我一个人吃饭旅行到处走走停停</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6749f5080ed328720a548c70</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6749f5080ed328720a548c70</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Nov 2024 19:53:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsRUa_8N8p8w4mSXMQqES7_C1lbW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>一个人的旅行，有时是最好的相遇。从东京到广岛新泻，从米其林餐厅到街边小店，一场说走就走的旅行往往能带来意想不到的惊喜。近期，日本旅游热度持续升温，但在“人从众”的潮流中，如何找到属于自己的独特体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span>刀刀日语几乎不会，五十音图刚学完（又忘得差不多了）；田田日语流利，非常融入本地休闲生活（坐在路边喝咖啡会被日本阿姨问路）。受惠于东航村村通，身在上海的语言基础差距甚大的两人频繁出入日本。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在今天的节目里，刀刀和田田将分享她们的日本独行攻略，带你发现不一样的日本风景。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 田田在东京看娄烨最新电影偶遇夏帆！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a> 坂本龙一监修音效的电影院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 住小津安二郎曾经住过的旅馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 洋气的湘南，洋气的茅崎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 旅行中你接收过的小纸条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> 樱花季节你是道明寺派还是长命寺派？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> 便利店是城市文明的象征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 「柳原良平从甲板远眺广阔海平面的远游雀跃与感动，我想让你知道。」——来自刀刀在茅崎看的展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a> 三得利和夏威夷的渊源，以及日本威士忌的缘起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a> 夏威夷是日本国民对于「旅行」憧憬的象征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 提前两三周就能订到 Tabelog 4.5 以上的「广岛双雄」，这在东京是不可能的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1741">29:01</a> Tabelog 使用心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 刀刀像五郎叔一样站在路口，发现了浅草一家隐藏庶民名店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2538">42:18</a> 地产地销，「地域密着」型餐厅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> 在二手 App 上也可以买农民种的蔬菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2973">49:33</a> 刀刀又像五郎叔一样站在路口，发现了吉祥寺一家“很像老年版小林聪美会开的店”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3322">55:22</a> Instagram 看甜品店要小心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3552">59:12</a> 不会日语在餐厅吃饭的经验和「负担」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3771">1:02:51</a> 「待客之道（おもてなし）」越来越稀缺和珍贵</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【提及】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🎬 </span><strong><span>东京看电影</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>东京 FILMeX 电影节：</span><a href="https://filmex.jp/" data-url="https://filmex.jp/"><span>filmex.jp</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>吉祥寺 UPLINK 电影院：</span><a href="https://joji.uplink.co.jp/" data-url="https://joji.uplink.co.jp/"><span>joji.uplink.co.jp</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>新宿 109 CINEMAS PREMIUM：</span><a href="https://109cinemas.net/premiumshinjuku/" data-url="https://109cinemas.net/premiumshinjuku/"><span>109cinemas.net</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>东京国际电影节：</span><a href="https://2024.tiff-jp.net/" data-url="https://2024.tiff-jp.net/"><span>2024.tiff-jp.net</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🏝️ </span><strong><span>茅崎</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>茅崎馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>小津安二郎；是枝裕和、工作室「分福」；电影「蜂蜜与四叶草」外景地；Suchmos 「MINT」MV外景地</span></p><span></span><p><span>茅崎市美术馆</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.chigasaki-museum.jp/" data-url="https://www.chigasaki-museum.jp/"><span>www.chigasaki-museum.jp</span></a><span> （注意是在公园「高砂绿地」内）</span></p><span></span><p><span>茅崎南方海岸 Southern Beach Chigasaki</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.city.chigasaki.kanagawa.jp/kankou_list/koen/1006949/1006955.html" data-url="https://www.city.chigasaki.kanagawa.jp/kankou_list/koen/1006949/1006955.html"><span>www.city.chigasaki.kanagawa.jp</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>南方群星 Southern All Stars</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://southernallstars.jp/" data-url="https://southernallstars.jp/"><span>southernallstars.jp</span></a><span> &nbsp;日本国民乐队，主唱&amp;吉他手桑田佳佑是茅崎人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>面包店 psipisna</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://psipsina.com/" data-url="https://psipsina.com/"><span>psipsina.com</span></a><span> &nbsp;湘南地区唯一的“硬欧”面包店</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍤 </span><strong><span>荞麦面店</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>茅崎 「手打ち蕎麦 賀久」 📍神奈川県茅ヶ崎市東海岸北3-13-20</span></p><span></span><p><span>浅草的传统平价站立式荞麦面店 「文殊 浅草店」 📍东京 Metro 浅草站内 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><em><span>推荐吃炸什锦荞麦面（かき揚げそば）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>东京市中心大手町的略高级新派站立式荞麦面店「港屋2」 📍東京都千代田区大手町1-9-1 星のや東京１階</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍜 </span><strong><span>银座 GINZA SIX 后的三家拉面</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「むぎとオリーブ 銀座本店」 📍東京都中央区銀座6-12-12 銀座ステラビル 1F</span></p><span></span><p><span>「銀座鴨そば 九代目けいすけ」 📍東京都中央区銀座6-12-15 いちご銀座612ビル 1F</span></p><span></span><p><span>「東京油組総本店 銀座組」 📍東京都中央区銀座6-12-16 片桐ビルⅡ １F &nbsp;</span><em><span>队伍太长了不值得排还不如去吃另外两家</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>柳原良平 - JAA meets YOKOHAMA 公開作品之一 「ペルリ提督とアンクル代官」</span></p><span></span><p><span>サザンオールスターズ - TSUNAMI</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期封面】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>田田当年用 iPhone SE 拍的茅崎馆后院</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期编辑】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>田田</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期制作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>刀刀</span></p>]]></description>
